summary:
  Today’s radiology news highlights advancements in AI's role in medicine, the use of imaging in Olympic sports, and new research on Parkinson's disease and liver health.  There are also findings on ADHD treatment effectiveness and a novel drug for jet lag recovery, representing potentially practice-changing developments.

